---
id: input
---

A single-line text field with its label and help. Shoelace's `sl-input`
supplies typing, validation, form participation and the label's association;
this identity supplies the look, drawn on its form-control parts.

## Visual Contract

<Page>
  <Component name="Input" status="stable" implements="sl-input"
    layoutMode="VERTICAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="FIXED" width={280}>
    <Frame name="form-control" part="form-control" layoutAlign="STRETCH"
      layoutMode="VERTICAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="FIXED" itemSpacing="{space#xs}">
      <Text name="label" part="form-control-label" characters="{label}" fontSize="{type#sm}" fontWeight="MEDIUM" fills="{color#text}" />
      <Frame name="base" part="base" layoutAlign="STRETCH"
        layoutMode="HORIZONTAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="FIXED" counterAxisSizingMode="AUTO"
        counterAxisAlignItems="CENTER" itemSpacing="{space#sm}"
        paddingLeft="{space#md}" paddingRight="{space#md}" paddingTop="{space#sm}" paddingBottom="{space#sm}"
        cornerRadius="{radius#md}" fills="{color#surface}" strokes="{color#border}" strokeWeight={1}>
        <Slot name="prefix" />
        <Text name="value" part="input" layoutGrow={1} characters="{placeholder}" fontSize="{type#md}" fills="{color#text-muted}" />
        <Slot name="suffix" />
      </Frame>
      <Text name="help" part="form-control-help-text" characters="{helpText}" fontSize="{type#sm}" fills="{color#text-muted}" />
    </Frame>
  </Component>
</Page>

<Styles>
  <Style state="focus" base:strokes="{color#accent}" />
  <Style state="disabled" root:opacity="{opacity#disabled}" />
</Styles>

## Contract

<Props>
  <Prop name="label" type="string" sample="Email">What the field asks for.</Prop>
  <Prop name="placeholder" type="string" sample="you@example.com">A hint shown while the field is empty.</Prop>
  <Prop name="helpText" type="string" sample="We never share it.">A sentence under the field.</Prop>
  <Prop name="value" type="string">What the field holds.</Prop>
  <Prop name="disabled" type="boolean" default={false} visual>Not editable, dimmed.</Prop>
</Props>
<Events>
  <Event name="change">Fires when an edit is committed.</Event>
</Events>
<Slots>
  <Slot name="prefix">An icon before the text.</Slot>
  <Slot name="suffix">An icon after the text.</Slot>
</Slots>
<Parts>
  <Part name="form-control">The label, field and help, stacked.</Part>
  <Part name="form-control-label">The label.</Part>
  <Part name="base">The field's box.</Part>
  <Part name="input">The native input.</Part>
  <Part name="form-control-help-text">The help sentence.</Part>
</Parts>
<Form participates submits="value under its name" />
<Accessibility role="textbox" label="from label" />

## Behavior

- label: the label names the field for assistive technology.
- change: fires `change` when the value is committed, not on every keystroke.
